{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "service-traces",
  "title": "Service Traces (RED Metrics)",
  "description": "Request rate, error rate and latency derived from OTel spans via spanmetrics connector",
  "tags": ["tracing", "RED", "otel"],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Datasource",
        "name": "ds_prometheus",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Request Rate (per service)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(soa_tourism_traces_calls_total[5m])) by (service_name)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {"lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"},
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Error Rate (per service)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(soa_tourism_traces_calls_total{status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m])) by (service_name)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {"lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"},
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "P95 Latency (per service)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 8, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(soa_tourism_traces_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, service_name))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {"lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"},
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "P50 Latency (per service)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 8, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prometheus}"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(soa_tourism_traces_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, service_name))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {"lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"},
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "How to explore individual traces",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 16, "w": 24, "h": 3},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Raw Trace Exploration\n\nTo browse individual traces, go to **Explore** → select **Tempo** datasource → search by `service.name = gateway` or `service.name = tour`.\n\nThe panels above derive **rate, error rate and latency** from span metadata (spanmetrics connector). They update every 15 seconds as Prometheus scrapes the OTel Collector."
      }
    }
  ]
}
